|YK0================================================================
                              |GKBENERVATE
|YK0================================================================

|YKB'What use is a body if the mind is vacant?'|WKO - |RKBMaster Gi Kwan|YK0

Monks require a great deal of wisdom in order to perform their
duties. This is often at the cost of their physical health.
Enervate is an ability that allows a Monk to quickly slip in and
out of a deep meditative trace, coming out of it with their
body hurting, but their spirit replenished.

|BK0This is a Master of the East Wind power.

